# ChatGPT / GPT supplemental rules for Surge
# Source reference: https://ip.net.coffee/gpt/site.html
# Maintained snapshot: 2026-10-20; not an automatically synchronized upstream feed.
# No proxy credentials or subscription URLs are stored in this file.
# Policy is assigned by the importing RULE-SET line (AIGC).

# Core domains: suffix matching also covers API and authentication subdomains.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,openai.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,chatgpt.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,chat.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,sora.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,oaistatic.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,oaiusercontent.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,crixet.com

# CDN and backend hosts listed by the source.
DOMAIN,openai.com.cdn.cloudflare.net
DOMAIN,openaicom.imgix.net
DOMAIN,openaiapi-site.azureedge.net
DOMAIN,production-openaicom-storage.azureedge.net
DOMAIN,openaicomproductionae4b.blob.core.windows.net
DOMAIN,openaicom-api-bdcpf8c6d2e9atf6.z01.azurefd.net
# Azure Web PubSub is shared infrastructure; this suffix also matches other apps.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,webpubsub.azure.com

# Verification endpoints; avoid matching all arkoselabs.com hosts.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,client-api.arkoselabs.com
DOMAIN,openai-api.arkoselabs.com

# Voice / realtime endpoints; some hosts may also be used by other applications.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,chatgpt.livekit.cloud
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,host.livekit.cloud
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,turn.livekit.cloud

# Telemetry endpoints listed by the source, without broad keyword rules.
DOMAIN,o33249.ingest.sentry.io
DOMAIN,browser-intake-datadoghq.com

# No broad CDN IP/ASN, NTP, or process-wide proxy rules are added.
